{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"buzz-finds-a-flower","version":1,"title":"Buzz Finds a Flower","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Buzz was a little bee. Zzz, zzz, zzz! She was hungry. She wanted something sweet.","sentences":["Buzz was a little bee.","Zzz, zzz, zzz!","She was hungry.","She wanted something sweet."],"alt":"A small striped bee flies in the morning sun.","image":{"hash":"sha256:f3019db075b36552f4e0b963bc4f23d486264353e44f5bcf4fcbcb9cf60fae71","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:6bd3c192e0d431b9b50c77216eb59cdac981818e7491f1bd9367c8926934eeb5","durationMs":13920,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3637],[3637,7399],[7399,10283],[10283,13920]],"words":[[0,502],[502,878],[878,1129],[1129,1881],[1881,3637],[3637,4640],[4640,5643],[5643,7399],[7399,7775],[7775,8151],[8151,10283],[10283,10659],[10659,11411],[11411,12540],[12540,13920]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Buzz flew over a hill. The hill was brown and bare. There were no flowers. Zzz, zzz.","sentences":["Buzz flew over a hill.","The hill was brown and bare.","There were no flowers.","Zzz, zzz."],"alt":"A bee flies over a bare brown hill.","image":{"hash":"sha256:08340df610bdbddb2423dc7d91065224b941d38668a33e4a7090fcefdf8eb965","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:198bdb55e06b57966ca1e3eed16bb6dc755f4ac7eaa890585976139398005883","durationMs":15720,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4220],[4220,9024],[9024,13245],[13245,15720]],"words":[[0,582],[582,1164],[1164,1746],[1746,2037],[2037,4220],[4220,4657],[4657,5239],[5239,5676],[5676,6404],[6404,6841],[6841,9024],[9024,9752],[9752,10334],[10334,10625],[10625,13245],[13245,14409],[14409,15720]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Buzz flew over a road. Honk, honk! A truck went by. There were no flowers there either.","sentences":["Buzz flew over a road.","Honk, honk!","A truck went by.","There were no flowers there either."],"alt":"A bee flies over a road with a truck.","image":{"hash":"sha256:e5db8f9d1313bfebd24b44a28172cbdd7efbbb093f2055b008c6dcac5bbd7e10","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:1fa2e5839d2a97ae7d8905f02d0028c49194fb6dd0bf915857c5582efb0394c8","durationMs":8520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2205],[2205,4031],[4031,5856],[5856,8520]],"words":[[0,304],[304,608],[608,912],[912,1064],[1064,2205],[2205,2890],[2890,4031],[4031,4183],[4183,4563],[4563,4867],[4867,5856],[5856,6236],[6236,6540],[6540,6692],[6692,7225],[7225,7605],[7605,8520]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Then Buzz saw one yellow flower. One! She landed on it. It had sweet juice inside. It is called nectar.","sentences":["Then Buzz saw one yellow flower.","One!","She landed on it.","It had sweet juice inside.","It is called nectar."],"alt":"A bee lands on one yellow flower.","image":{"hash":"sha256:c51a5a6eb61c66138ff63ed1ed2c1579dd9da8e3c4080ac6446d577fa26da74c","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:f687b33a549a091a9f4385f46839ef28df3724041c0cd26ed69f1c232f902457","durationMs":16000,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4589],[4589,6325],[6325,9301],[9301,13270],[13270,16000]],"words":[[0,496],[496,992],[992,1364],[1364,1736],[1736,2480],[2480,4589],[4589,6325],[6325,6697],[6697,7441],[7441,7689],[7689,9301],[9301,9549],[9549,9921],[9921,10541],[10541,11161],[11161,13270],[13270,13518],[13518,13766],[13766,14510],[14510,16000]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Yellow dust stuck to her legs. It is called pollen. Buzz flew to the next flower. Two! The pollen fell off. That helps flowers make seeds.","sentences":["Yellow dust stuck to her legs.","It is called pollen.","Buzz flew to the next flower.","Two!","The pollen fell off.","That helps flowers make seeds."],"alt":"A bee with yellow dust on her legs lands on a second flower.","image":{"hash":"sha256:064defea69557e189e636b8cfb6bbba4698cb3a54ca464d8aec526d8d6fc3ac0","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e10c8ad443f465645f791996762be76ea44e541aed82467d9ff9505755c60d09","durationMs":17200,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3584],[3584,6348],[6348,9830],[9830,11263],[11263,14027],[14027,17200]],"words":[[0,614],[614,1024],[1024,1536],[1536,1741],[1741,2048],[2048,3584],[3584,3789],[3789,3994],[3994,4608],[4608,6348],[6348,6758],[6758,7168],[7168,7373],[7373,7680],[7680,8090],[8090,9830],[9830,11263],[11263,11570],[11570,12184],[12184,12594],[12594,14027],[14027,14437],[14437,14949],[14949,15666],[15666,16076],[16076,17200]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"A girl named Afi saw Buzz. ‘Bees like flowers,’ she said. ‘I will plant more!’ She put seeds in the soil.","sentences":["A girl named Afi saw Buzz.","‘Bees like flowers,’ she said.","‘I will plant more!’ She put seeds in the soil."],"alt":"A girl plants seeds in soil beside a bee.","image":{"hash":"sha256:bc0c450e4cd0b361a177b3b807d17c3d3b7ddda1f42696314d3f6ef6356ad2f7","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:2c0f31f7fea994321c4651161c7f0d57df8745de268bd13b3be9263503367f41","durationMs":13360,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3506],[3506,7668],[7668,13360]],"words":[[0,219],[219,657],[657,1205],[1205,1534],[1534,1863],[1863,3506],[3506,3944],[3944,4382],[4382,5696],[5696,6025],[6025,7668],[7668,7887],[7887,8325],[8325,8873],[8873,10516],[10516,10845],[10845,11174],[11174,11722],[11722,11941],[11941,12270],[12270,13360]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Afi gave the seeds water. Soon there were three, four, five flowers! Buzz went from flower to flower.","sentences":["Afi gave the seeds water.","Soon there were three, four, five flowers!","Buzz went from flower to flower."],"alt":"A girl waters a row of five flowers while a bee hovers.","image":{"hash":"sha256:94befe27d7b5774efc20e349df6b7ce6a468cd6b4699053fccb7ed4df681fca9","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:5f3852f32792127e39828597298405c8307d7deff284e0f004f027fcfae93d8e","durationMs":16080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4260],[4260,11682],[11682,16080]],"words":[[0,412],[412,962],[962,1374],[1374,2061],[2061,4260],[4260,4810],[4810,5497],[5497,6047],[6047,7421],[7421,8658],[8658,9208],[9208,11682],[11682,12232],[12232,12782],[12782,13332],[13332,14157],[14157,14432],[14432,16080]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Buzz was not hungry any more. Zzz, zzz, zzz! She hummed a happy song. The end.","sentences":["Buzz was not hungry any more.","Zzz, zzz, zzz!","She hummed a happy song.","The end."],"alt":"A happy bee rests on a flower in the sun.","image":{"hash":"sha256:12f4f0929918eefcdd0c756a79de4c26239ddbe9987382f890df653ec3268fb5","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:98e2ed1348b3c6d6d2a5ccddad3a6034f5dfeb129f0142a7bc240642946f5ba9","durationMs":14800,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4703],[4703,8853],[8853,13142],[13142,14800]],"words":[[0,553],[553,968],[968,1383],[1383,2213],[2213,2628],[2628,4703],[4703,5810],[5810,6917],[6917,8853],[8853,9268],[9268,10098],[10098,10375],[10375,11067],[11067,13142],[13142,13557],[13557,14800]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"buzz-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":1,"question":"What was the bee called?","options":["Buzz","Afi","Honk"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"buzz-p1","type":"prediction","afterPage":3,"prompt":"Buzz is hungry. What does she want to find? Tell a friend.","options":["Flowers","A truck"]},{"id":"buzz-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":6,"targetSound":"b","prompt":"Which words start with the b sound, like Buzz?","options":["bee","flower","bare","sun"],"correctIndexes":[0,2]},{"id":"buzz-s1","type":"sequencing","prompt":"Put the story in order.","items":["Buzz was hungry.","Buzz found one flower.","Afi planted more flowers."]},{"id":"buzz-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Afi planted flowers to help the bee. How do you feel when you help?","feelingOptions":["Kind","Happy","Proud","Sleepy"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"nectar","definition":"The sweet juice inside a flower.","pages":[4]},{"word":"pollen","definition":"Yellow dust inside a flower that helps it make seeds.","pages":[5]},{"word":"hungry","definition":"Wanting to eat.","pages":[1]}],"assets":{"sha256:f3019db075b36552f4e0b963bc4f23d486264353e44f5bcf4fcbcb9cf60fae71":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page1-1.webp","bytes":96236,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:6bd3c192e0d431b9b50c77216eb59cdac981818e7491f1bd9367c8926934eeb5":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/6bd3c192e0d4.mp3","bytes":111980,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:08340df610bdbddb2423dc7d91065224b941d38668a33e4a7090fcefdf8eb965":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page2-1.webp","bytes":65010,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:198bdb55e06b57966ca1e3eed16bb6dc755f4ac7eaa890585976139398005883":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/198bdb55e06b.mp3","bytes":126380,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:e5db8f9d1313bfebd24b44a28172cbdd7efbbb093f2055b008c6dcac5bbd7e10":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page3-1.webp","bytes":111508,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:1fa2e5839d2a97ae7d8905f02d0028c49194fb6dd0bf915857c5582efb0394c8":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/1fa2e5839d2a.mp3","bytes":34509,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:c51a5a6eb61c66138ff63ed1ed2c1579dd9da8e3c4080ac6446d577fa26da74c":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page4-1.webp","bytes":62968,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:f687b33a549a091a9f4385f46839ef28df3724041c0cd26ed69f1c232f902457":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/f687b33a549a.mp3","bytes":128684,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:064defea69557e189e636b8cfb6bbba4698cb3a54ca464d8aec526d8d6fc3ac0":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/buzz-finds-a-flower/page5-1.webp","bytes":66290,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:e10c8ad443f465645f791996762be76ea44e541aed82467d9ff9505755c60d09":{"path":"/stor